This program writes configuration records to a USB HID device. Incorrect use
may leave the device in an unwanted state. It is distributed WITHOUT ANY
WARRANTY; see the GPL-3.0 license text. The authors are not responsible for
damage to hardware or data. Bluetooth configuration is not supported because
that path exposes no vendor HID config interface on Linux.
